idth="262"/></a></h1><div class="header_buttons"><a data-label="browse" class="header_button browse_btn" href="/games">Browse Games</a><a data-label="jams" class="header_button jams_btn" href="/jams">Game Jams</a><a data-label="developers" class="header_button developers_btn" href="/developers"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-upload"></span>Upload Game</a><a data-label="devlogs" class="header_button devlogs_btn" href="/devlogs">Developer Logs</a><a data-label="community.home" class="header_button community.home_btn" href="/community">Community</a></div><form class="game_search" action="/search"><input required="required" class="search_input" type="text" name="q" placeholder="Search for games, jams, tags or creators"/><button aria-label="Search" class="submit_btn"><svg stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden stroke-width="3" fill="none" role="img" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svgicon icon_search" version="1.1"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form><div class="user_panel_widget base_widget" id="user_panel_2936800"><a data-register_action="header" class="panel_button" data-label="log_in" href="/login">Log in</a><a data-register_action="header" class="panel_button register_button" data-label="register" href="/register">Register</a></div></div><div data-target="browse" class="header_dropdown"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default after_voting is_over has_banner" id="view_jam_9824106"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI3Njg1Mjc2LnBuZw==/original/Nyk1%2Ba.png" class="jam_banner "/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_6330674"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57">Mini Jame Gam #57</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://tiimo.itch.io">tiimo</a>, <a href="https://jamegam.itch.io">Jame Gam</a>, <a href="https://acidburritos.itch.io">AcidBurritos</a>, <a href="https://amiablevegetable.itch.io">AmiableVegetable</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/JameGam">#JameGam</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><a href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57/entries"><div class="stat_value">74</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">884</div><div class="stat_label">Ratings</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a data-label="tab_view_jam" class="header_tab active" href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57">Overview</a><a data-label="tab_view_jam_entries" class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57/entries">Submissions</a><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57/results">Results</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">9</span></div><a data-label="tab_view_jam_feed" class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57/feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget after_voting is_over" id="jam_submitter_7653303"><p>This jam is now over. It ran from <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-07-24 11:00:00</span> to <span data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A" class="date_format">2026-07-26 21:30:00</span>. <a href="/jam/mini-jame-gam-57/results">View results</a></p></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><p><strong>Jame Gam</strong> is a beginner friendly game jam for people who want to have fun, meet new people and learn game development.</p>
<p>In this game jam you have a limited time to create a game or a prototype. After the submission window is closed you have 3 days to play and vote the games and,&nbsp;after that, a winner will be selected.</p>
<p>The jam will have a theme and a special object. Your game should be&nbsp;based around the theme, which gets revealed when the jam starts. The special object should be in your game, and should play a somewhat important role.</p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 class="text-center">Theme &amp; Special Object</h1>
<div class="custom-columns">
<div class="custom-left-col">
<p class="custom-theme">Theme</p>
<p>Tidying Up</p>
</div>
<div class="custom-right-col">
<p class="custom-theme">Special Object</p>
<p>Blanket</p></div></div>
<p><br></p>
<h1>Rules</h1>
<p>
</p>
<p>• Your game must be made specifically for the jam&nbsp;</p>
<p>• Your game must be made during the submission window&nbsp;</p>
<p>• Your game must follow the theme and contain the special object</p>
<p>• Don&#x27;t make any&nbsp;NSFW or offensive/discriminatory games</p>
<p>• If you aren&#x27;t sure if you&#x27;re breaking the rules ask on&nbsp;<a href="https://discord.gg/2aTcwH2" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">our discord server</a></p>
<p></p>
<p><br></p>
<h1>Rating</h1>
<p>The entries will be rated based on the following criteria:</p>
<p><strong>• Theme Implementation</strong></p>
<p><strong>• Special Feature Implementation</strong></p>
<p><strong>• Fun Factor</strong></p>
<p><strong>• Gameplay</strong></p>
<p><strong>• Audio</strong></p>
<p><strong>• Visuals</strong></p>
<p></p>
<p><a href="https://discord.gg/2aTcwH2" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Join our Discord Server</a> for more Help and more Informations.</p>
<div class="custom-qa">
<h1>Q&A</h1>
<details>
    <summary>Can we team up?</summary>
    <p>YES! You can ask for teammates on our <a href="https://discord.gg/2aTcwH2" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Discord server</a>!</p>
</details>
<details>
    <summary>Can I use ANY Game Engine?</summary>
    <p>YES! You can even create a game without an engine (We won&#x27;t recommend it, though).</p>
</details>
<details>
    <summary>Can I use assets?</summary>
    <p>YES! You can use your own or third-party assets, as long as you have the rights and provide proper credit!</p>
</details>
<details>
    <summary>What is a Special Object?</summary>
    <p>The special object is an object that needs to be in your game, and has to be somewhat important.</p>
</details>
<details>
    <summary>I have a different problem, and I need help!</summary>
    <p>Just join our <a href="https://discord.gg/2aTcwH2" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Discord server</a>, and ask for help in the #help channel!</p></details>
</div></div></div><div id="entries" class="grid_outer"><div class="header_row"><h2>Submissions<span class="game_count">(73)</span></h2></div><div class="jam_filter_picker"><div class="filter_item active">All submissions</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_web" class="filter_item">Browser playable (53)</div><span class="divider"> · </span><div data-filter="filter_windows" class="filter_item">Windows (22)</div><div data-filter="filter_osx" class="filter_item">macOS (1)</div><div data-filter="filter_linux" class="filter_item">Linux (3)</div><div data-filter="filter_android" class="filter_item">Android (1)</div></div><div class="jam_filter_empty"><p>No submissions match your filter</p></div><div class="game_grid_widget base_widget browse_game_grid"><div dir="auto" class="game_cell filter_windows has_cover lazy_images" data-game_id="4825822"><div style="background-color:#2d0000;" class="game_thumb"><a tabindex="-1" class="thumb_link game_link" href="https://figerox.itch.io/fresh-meat-for-dead-lucy" data-label="game:4825822:thumb" data-action="game_grid"><img class="lazy_loaded" width="315" height="250" data-lazy_src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4ODM2NTMxLnBuZw==/315x250%23c/%2BkkHRq.png"/></a><div class="game_cell_tools"><a class="action_btn add_to_collection_btn" data-register_action="add_to_collection" href="/g/figerox/fresh-meat-for-dead-lucy/add-to-collection"><span class="icon icon-playlist_add"></span>Add to collection</a></div></div><div class="game_cell_data"><div class="game_title"><a class="title game_link" href="https://figerox.itch.io/fresh-meat-for-dead-lucy" data-label="game:4825822:title" data-action="game_grid">Fresh Meat For Dead Lucy</a></div><div title="Oh boy, did we ever make a mess.." class="game_text">Oh boy, did we ever make a mess..</div><div class="game_author"><a data-action="game_grid" data-label="user:6150070" href="https://figerox.itch.io">Figerox Studios</a></div><div class="game_genre">Interactive Fiction</div><d